{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/pulls/2049","id":16024590,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MTYwMjQ1OTA=","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/2049","diff_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/2049.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/2049.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2049","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/pulls/2049/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/pulls/2049/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2049/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/statuses/046302c0cbe94588cdaf6460dfc49219b49db389","number":2049,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"Separated out proxy_manager_for to fix #2048","user":{"login":"codedstructure","id":477909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzkwOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/477909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure","html_url":"https://github.com/codedstructure","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedstructure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Basically identical to @sigmavirus24's suggested code - thanks for that pointer. Just added docstring.\n\nThere aren't tests for particular Adapter implementations, and I've not added any at this stage.\nI have tested it with the following (which achieves what I want):\n\n```\nclass SourceAddressAdapter(requests.adapters.HTTPAdapter):\n    \"\"\"\n    A Requests HTTP adapter to add source address specification for proxies\n    \"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, *o, **k):\n        self.source_address = k.pop('source_address', None)\n        super(SourceAddressAdapter, self).__init__(*o, **k)\n\n    def proxy_manager_for(self, proxy):\n        conn_params = {}\n        if self.source_address is not None:\n            conn_params['source_address'] = (self.source_address, 0)\n\n        if not proxy in self.proxy_manager:\n            proxy_headers = self.proxy_headers(proxy)\n            self.proxy_manager[proxy] = requests.adapters.proxy_from_url(\n                proxy,\n                proxy_headers=proxy_headers,\n                num_pools=self._pool_connections,\n                maxsize=self._pool_maxsize,\n                block=self._pool_block,\n                **conn_params)\n\n        return self.proxy_manager[proxy]\n```\n","labels":[{"id":117745,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTc3NDU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/labels/Planned","name":"Planned","description":null,"color":"e102d8","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":44501305,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NDUwMTMwNQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/labels/Not%20Ready%20To%20Merge","name":"Not Ready To Merge","description":null,"color":"e11d21","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","created_at":"2014-05-17T22:42:52Z","updated_at":"2021-09-08T23:07:11Z","closed_at":"2014-06-23T19:11:13Z","merged_at":"2014-06-23T19:11:13Z","merge_commit_sha":"0aaec99f66fc067da1145e16d8df2f2b5e6cd48c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"